  unitName: Lovestruck Sergio (EU)
  unitId: 720104
  unitNumber: 7039
  description: A knight from the ruined Sama Kingdom. Injured in the fight against
    the gods, he collapsed and was prepared to die. But as the final strike came,
    his troops rushed forward to protect him. Though he refused to befriend them,
    many of them admired his indifference. Watching them, Sergio found the strength
    to swing his sword of ice to protect the people.
  summonDesc: What kind of strength can you give me?<br>Will that be worth a swing
    of my sword?
  fusionDesc: "To be strengthened by one whom I thought of as a burden\u2026<br>Such
    irony."
  evoDesc: Strength comes from solitude.<br>Why then did I fail to find power<br>in
    my isolation?<br>
